    "regime_notes": "Strong aggregate 10-day cross-sectional predictive power across the 15-instrument benchmark, with positive annual IC in 2027-2029 and 2031-2032, but negative readings in 2026, 2030, and 2033 year-to-date. Longer-horizon decay reverses, so use specifically at the 10-day rebalance horizon and interpret uncertainty conservatively for the small cross-section.",
